          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Service “{0}” has {1} “{2}”, which was observed as {3} around startup, but its creation by Dev Switcher cannot be confirmed. It was not stopped automatically because the app has no stop authority. Start again to review how to handle the current stack.\n{4}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プロセスが一致しません（記録した PID {0} の開始 abstime {1} / 実測 {2}）。PID が再利用された可能性があります。": {
